WEBVTT

00:08:28.462 --> 00:08:30.005
(Laughter)

00:08:30.047 --> 00:08:31.674
(Applause)

00:08:34.593 --> 00:08:36.929
The limited imaginings of the few

00:08:36.971 --> 00:08:41.433
should not colonize
the radical re-imaginings of the many.

00:08:42.309 --> 00:08:46.897
So how then do we ensure
that we design an ethical baseline,

00:08:46.897 --> 00:08:53.028
so that the liberation that this promises
is not just for a privileged few,

00:08:53.028 --> 00:08:54.572
but for all of us?

00:08:55.698 --> 00:08:59.535
There are a few examples
that can point to a way forward.

00:08:59.577 --> 00:09:03.455
I love the work of Indigenous AI